@Zenbet.Api_HostAddress = http://localhost:5095

GET {{Zenbet.Api_HostAddress}}/weatherforecast/
Accept: application/json

### Obtener cartelera de partidos de fútbol activos
GET {{Zenbet.Api_HostAddress}}/api/sports/football
Accept: application/json

###

### Obtener partidos de fútbol filtrados por liga
GET {{Zenbet.Api_HostAddress}}/api/sports/football?league=Premier%20League
Accept: application/json

###

### Obtener partido de fútbol por ID
GET {{Zenbet.Api_HostAddress}}/api/sports/football/1
Accept: application/json

###
